    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 7th level, the cartomancer may expend an additional use of the tell fortune class feature when telling a mark's fortune to roll twice on <strong>Table: Tell Fortune Outcomes</strong> instead of just once. The mark gains the benefits, and penalties, of both rolls.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancer#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
